{"2349140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KONOSUBA - God's Blessing on this Wonderful World! Love For These Clothes Of Desire!", "steam_appid": 2349140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2590900, 2590890, 2590880], "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/6ee542daa41914c3225203fde731fa16.avif?t=1725895250\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Follow Kazuma and company, as they discover a mysterious &quot;Black Slab&quot; which curses them with desires contrary to their personality. The gang must now find and feed ingredients to the slab to create outfits which match and fulfil their new desires, and thus break their curse. Are you ready to meet Darkness as a ruthless dominatrix? How about Aqua as a prim and proper goddess? Or Megumin as the proud leader of the Lolita League?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/a85c1a633bfb3924a2530b22b1839fb6.webp?t=1725895250\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/a85c1a633bfb3924a2530b22b1839fb6.poster.avif?t=1725895250\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=150 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/506da051abc1799093b5e8daf15ac8e9.avif?t=1725895250\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Witness a new story in visual novel form! Featuring a full cast of fan-favourite characters from the series, this wild adventure gives you the chance to build up affection with up to seven heroines!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/2615268d51a1583193253abb3bbca321.webp?t=1725895250\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/2615268d51a1583193253abb3bbca321.poster.avif?t=1725895250\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=150 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/da3d4dc679bfea92dea56cecd02b3ff8.avif?t=1725895250\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Fill out a weekly planner for each character based on their strengths to earn funds and resources which can be used for making outfits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/018cd9c5d73599c376744ec70d45497c.webp?t=1725895250\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/018cd9c5d73599c376744ec70d45497c.poster.avif?t=1725895250\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=150 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/7f6b0532d1da89fe029deb492fe1812f.avif?t=1725895250\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Each of them has her own story endings and special dress-up CGs, so pick your words wisely and avoid invoking their wrath! Your choices matter! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/e0eb30026ddfab715b414eef80b2bb60.webp?t=1725895250\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/e0eb30026ddfab715b414eef80b2bb60.poster.avif?t=1725895250\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=150 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/fb1d04237340457535b1b76c30cce2b4.avif?t=1725895250\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Collect resources to create outfits by completing tasks and quests. Manage your finances carefully to afford the materials you are missing, and prioritise gathering the outfit-specific ingredients you will need.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/16de1a07b8ef55595f968e8c4e426f98.webp?t=1725895250\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/16de1a07b8ef55595f968e8c4e426f98.poster.avif?t=1725895250\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=150 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/444a8d63cc6fd258433ea49c4d85689e.avif?t=1725895250\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Once the mystical outfits have been made it’s time to play dress-up! Be ready for twists and turns as your favourite characters’ personalities change with each curse and desire-fulfilling piece of clothing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/b62ca7db5bec0b09a430bba04c2a92e2.webp?t=1725895250\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/b62ca7db5bec0b09a430bba04c2a92e2.poster.avif?t=1725895250\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/6ee542daa41914c3225203fde731fa16.avif?t=1725895250\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Follow Kazuma and company, as they discover a mysterious &quot;Black Slab&quot; which curses them with desires contrary to their personality. The gang must now find and feed ingredients to the slab to create outfits which match and fulfil their new desires, and thus break their curse. Are you ready to meet Darkness as a ruthless dominatrix? How about Aqua as a prim and proper goddess? Or Megumin as the proud leader of the Lolita League?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/a85c1a633bfb3924a2530b22b1839fb6.webp?t=1725895250\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/a85c1a633bfb3924a2530b22b1839fb6.poster.avif?t=1725895250\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=150 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/506da051abc1799093b5e8daf15ac8e9.avif?t=1725895250\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Witness a new story in visual novel form! Featuring a full cast of fan-favourite characters from the series, this wild adventure gives you the chance to build up affection with up to seven heroines!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/2615268d51a1583193253abb3bbca321.webp?t=1725895250\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/2615268d51a1583193253abb3bbca321.poster.avif?t=1725895250\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=150 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/da3d4dc679bfea92dea56cecd02b3ff8.avif?t=1725895250\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Fill out a weekly planner for each character based on their strengths to earn funds and resources which can be used for making outfits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/018cd9c5d73599c376744ec70d45497c.webp?t=1725895250\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/018cd9c5d73599c376744ec70d45497c.poster.avif?t=1725895250\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=150 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/7f6b0532d1da89fe029deb492fe1812f.avif?t=1725895250\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Each of them has her own story endings and special dress-up CGs, so pick your words wisely and avoid invoking their wrath! Your choices matter! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/e0eb30026ddfab715b414eef80b2bb60.webp?t=1725895250\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/e0eb30026ddfab715b414eef80b2bb60.poster.avif?t=1725895250\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=150 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/fb1d04237340457535b1b76c30cce2b4.avif?t=1725895250\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Collect resources to create outfits by completing tasks and quests. Manage your finances carefully to afford the materials you are missing, and prioritise gathering the outfit-specific ingredients you will need.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/16de1a07b8ef55595f968e8c4e426f98.webp?t=1725895250\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/16de1a07b8ef55595f968e8c4e426f98.poster.avif?t=1725895250\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=150 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/444a8d63cc6fd258433ea49c4d85689e.avif?t=1725895250\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Once the mystical outfits have been made it’s time to play dress-up! Be ready for twists and turns as your favourite characters’ personalities change with each curse and desire-fulfilling piece of clothing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/b62ca7db5bec0b09a430bba04c2a92e2.webp?t=1725895250\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/extras/b62ca7db5bec0b09a430bba04c2a92e2.poster.avif?t=1725895250\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span>", "short_description": "It's time for a Visual Novel Quest with a twist! Join Kazuma, a reincarnated adventurer, and spend turbulent days with his unfortunate party members. Prepare for waifus, dress-up and resource management and get ready for an Isekai comedy that’s out of this world!", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“If you had any love for Konosuba!, then you’re going to want to pick up this game. If you’re looking for a hilarious tale that is as lewd as it is self-aware, you’ll want this game.”<br>9/10 – WayTooManyGames<br><br>“Konosuba: Love for These Clothes of Desire goes far beyond what you’d expect from an anime video game adaptation.”<br>8/10 – Noisy Pixel<br><br>“KONOSUBA is a very popular anime that deserves a comical and authentic video game adaptation, and that’s exactly what this game is.”<br>4.2/5 – GamesCreed<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/header.jpg?t=1725895250", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1725895250", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1725895250", "website": "https://pqube.co.uk/games/konosuba/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><